  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2315,
      "text": "Lord of the heavens and earth and all that is between them. So worship Him and be constant in worshiping Him. Do you know anyone equal to Him?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 267,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2316,
      "text": "Man says, “Once I am dead, will I be raised to life again?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2317,
      "text": "Does man not remember that We created him beforehand when he was nothing?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2318,
      "text": "By your Lord, We will surely gather them and the devils, then We will surely bring them all around Hell on their knees[19].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2319,
      "text": "Then We will surely drag out of every group those who were most rebellious against the Most Compassionate.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2320,
      "text": "For indeed We know best those who are most deserving to burn therein.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2321,
      "text": "There is none among you except that he will pass over it[20]; a decree from your Lord that must be fulfilled.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2322,
      "text": "Then We will save those who fear Allah and will leave the wrongdoers in it on their knees.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2323,
      "text": "When Our verses are recited to them in all their clarity, the disbelievers say to the believers, “Which of the two parties is better in terms of dwellings and superior in social gatherings?”[21]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2324,
      "text": "How many generations We have destroyed before them who were superior in terms of wealth and outward appearance!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2325,
      "text": "Say, “Whoever is following misguidance, the Most Compassionate will give him respite, until they see what they were warned of – be it the punishment [in this world] or the Hour – only then will they realize who is in a worse abode and who has a smaller following.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 310,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2326,
      "text": "Allah increases in guidance those who are guided, and the righteous deeds of lasting merit are better with your Lord in reward and better in return.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
